        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy waawutmo Dario hara'aya gari oó', leelehhit kuri iimu/ún baraá gixsár Babuloniro baraá do'odá' muruú inslaslángw wa hariím oo waawutmo kway baabatsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitaábuú wák kuri sláy baraá Ekbatana wa alé, gixsadá' ur ar ayaá Media, nee baraadae /ayma'aá taa gooín an kuká', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kurkú geera oo waawuti'iimár waawutmo Koreshi, waawutmo Koreshi hara'aya gana oó' ar doó Mungú kuduú baraá yaamaá Yerusalemu kuwa /abeesi tlehhmuuwo dír ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i kawa hanmiisi nee ilahhooa da/a/aangw kawa hanmiisi. Tlenaango a miíta mibeeri tsár nee faanqw, nee uroó bihheero a miíta mibeeri tsár nee faanqw sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masók koo/irós kan tleehh hhai tám awa tlaa/eedá' uren, nee hháw wák oo xaai gawaá daanduú kuduú tlaa/eewo. Bu'utuú muruuwí kungu baraá daqaari'iimár waawutmoó wa duuxi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee xooslár sahaábu nee ar peésa ar doó Mungú, tidá' waawutmo Nebukadnesa aa duúx baraá Doó Mungú wa alé kuduú Yerusalemu, gari huúw ay baraá yaamaá Babuloni, ki/isak, ki dahasá' malé alé baraá Doó Mungú kuduú Yerusalemu, umuú xoslmoowo dirós ti ki/ise', nee kuúng ki dahás baraá Doó Mungú.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gawaá adoorihe kuúng Tatenai, ga/aawusmoó yaamaá gayuú /uwa awa yaaér Eufrate, nee kuúng Shetar-bosenai, nee ga/aawuusér hatlá' ar yaamaá gayuú /uwa yaaér Eufratero, ma amoodá' i daqawara'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gadiyeésír Doó Mungú mawaak, ma il/aamara', ga/aawusmoó múk Yahudi nee bariisér Yahudiro do'osíng oo Mungú ngu tleehhiye' dirós tidár aáng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám an malé kah, kuungá' muksíng ale/iisaak baraá gadiyeérihe. Bu'utuuín sleémeero hanisaak, mu tligisara' baraá daqaari'iimár waawutmo tiwa duxe' nee baraá ohmeedá' tinda burumburín dír ayeemoosá gayuú /uwa yaaér Eufratero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee umuúqo gár i slaiia haniisaak, bar awér nakw nee gwaandaawe, laqaá bee/aangw as tawa ilahhooár ta da/i dír Munguú doorí alé, nee angaáno nee diwi nee difaái, laqaá di/i, ar adór kaahamuusér baraá Yerusalemu ta ooi, muruuwí ku hanmiisi umuúqo deeloro, mu mawaara' hanmisuuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As inooín Munguú gawaá doori nguwa ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i ar sla'atamis i hanmisiya', nee slafíngw waawutmo nee na/iiwós nguwa aleefirina'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slamí an malé kah, barnaxes hee /aymuuwí gwaa warqeés, waaqaasi ka duuxi baraá do'ós wa alé, ka inós ar muti nee waaqaasi ka sihhtisi, inós i gawaadá' wa tarereamiti, nee do'ós ku ufuú xwaansláy tleehhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee Munguúwí adoorí gaa tleehh umuuwós iwa dirqá' hooti, inós waawutmo laqaá muu gaalá kudá' dabaaín ngi tleesá' as /aymuuwí nguwa warqeesiya' nee do'owí oo Mungú oo baraá yaamaá Yerusalemu ngu hhaamiisá' ngi suquy. Aníng Dario tí ngaa oó', masók ta ilakaaharees hara'ayarí kawa iialooeesi.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Tatenai ga/aawusmoó ayaá gayuú /uwa yaaér Eufratero nee Shetar-bosenasi nee ga/aawuusér hatlá', tana ilakaahareés hara'ayár waawutmo Dario kawa iialooeesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee bariisér múk Yahudi tay kumiít tlehhmuuwo, gadiyeé iri ya/aán ar adoodá' aaru'uumár aarusmo Hagai nee Sekaria garmoó Ido i diri'. Inooín tlehhmuú doó Mungú kuri hhe'eés ar adoodá' kira hara'ayín nee Munguú Israeli, nee ar adoodá' kara oó' nee Koreshi, nee Dario, nee Artashasta waawutmoó yaamaá Persia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do'owí iwa hhooáy tlehhmuuwo a bál slahhángw Adari tawa tám, baraá kurkú lahhoó' oo waawuti'iimár waawutmo Dario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli, nee kahaamuuse nee múk tlahhoó Laáwi, nee múk hatlá' oo naa baraá looháy wa waatl, do'owuú Mungú kuri aldafín ar qwal/uú yaariír. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín do'owí oo Mungú kuwa aldafin inooín ilahhooa awe tsiiruú wák kana haniís, gwaandaawe tsiire tsár, nee deeloó bee/aangw tsiire tsiyáhh as hingemisuú tlakweemaá múk Israeli sleémeero, nee gurtaawe mibaá nee tsár ar adoodá' faarór tlahh'aá xoorór Israeli i diri'iya'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee inooín kaahamuuse kari qaás baraá gadiyér Mungú, nee múk tlahhoó Laáwi kuna qaás baraá baalaqaasir'ín, as gadiyér Mungú baraá Yerusalemuro, adoodá' kara gooín baraá kitaábuú Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál slahhángw geera tawa mibaá nee tsiyáhh, mukdá' naa baraá looháy wa waatl deelór ur ar Pasaáka ngiri tleehhiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamuuse sleémeero nee múk tlahhoó Laáwi tiri hhehhe'eesiyé', inooín sleémeero niri hhoohhouyé'. Deelmoó bee/i nguna gaasiyé' as mukdá' naa baraá looháy wa waatl nee as hhaeeín awa kaahamuuse nee as daandeemoín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelmooduú Pasaáka kuri /aáy nee muu sleémeero oo Israeli kudá' naa baraá looháy wa waatl, dinkwa nee umuúqo heewo oo taa paraatl dír múk slasla/aruú xoordaá yaamuudae tay haragwaá' dír múk Israeli as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli kuwa sluufmiisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelór ur ar mikaátér taa sluuftisiiká kari tleéhh ar qwala/ ar afiqoomár deelo faanqw, asma AAKOÓ MUNGÚ inooín gina qwal/atís nee muunuú waawutmoó Ashuru guri warqeés as múk Israeli nguwa slai, inooín giri ale/iís as ngiwa /uurií qaasi baraá gadiyér tlehhmuú doó Munguhe, Munguú Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
